---
description: Keep every OpenMontage dependency installation reproducible and documented
alwaysApply: true
---

# Dependency Installation Record

- Read `docs/INSTALLATION_GUIDE.md` before installing, removing, or upgrading anything.
- Update the correct requirements, Conda, Node, or system-dependency manifest before installation.
- Add an installation-ledger entry with date, dependency, requested constraint, target environment, reason, and planned verification.
- After installation, record the resolved version and verification outcome.
- Update `educational_agent_cli setup` or another preflight when the dependency is production-required.
- Never make a manual install the only source of truth.
- Never write API keys, tokens, passwords, or secret values into manifests, guides, logs, or commands.
